        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 7.63×25mm Mauser, .30 Mauser Automatic, Mauser C96\n- Companies: Mauser\n- Places: Germany\n- Topics: semi-automatic pistols, cartridges\n\nFacts:\n- Mauser originally produced the Mauser C96 semi-automatic pistol in Germany from 1896 to 1937.\n- The 7.63×25mm Mauser cartridge, also called the .30 Mauser Automatic, was the original cartridge for the Mauser C96 service pistol.",
